@startuml
title Storyteller - Simplified Story Flow

start
:Receive story input from CLI or API client;
:Load the adapter's session context;
:Use Core prompt builders to assemble model messages;
:Send request to the OpenAI-compatible backend;
:Receive draft response;
if (validation enabled?) then (yes)
  :Validate draft against rules and fixed protagonists;
  :Use ALLOW draft or REPLACE text;
else (no)
  :Sanitize and use draft;
endif
:Persist the completed turn through the active adapter;
:Return response to terminal or HTTP client;
stop
@enduml
